                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maana kule kusema, Usizini, Usiue, Usiibe, Usitamani; na ikiwapo amri nyingine yo yote, inajumlishwa katika neno hili, ya kwamba, Mpende jirani yako kama nafsi yako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
